msgstr "LPK候補者登録 - 利用ガイド"

msgid "Welcome to LPK Candidate Management"
msgstr "LPK候補者管理へようこそ"

msgid "This module allows authorized LPK institutions to register and manage apprentice candidates. All data is stored in <strong>cms_lpk_candidates</strong> database."
msgstr "このモジュールでは、認可されたLPK機関が技能実習生の候補者を登録・管理できます。データはすべて <strong>cms_lpk_candidates</strong> データベースに保存されます。"

msgid "<strong>Important:</strong> You can only see and manage candidates registered by YOUR institution. Other LPK candidates are not visible to you."
msgstr "<strong>重要：</strong>閲覧・管理できるのは自機関が登録した候補者のみです。他のLPKの候補者は表示されません。"

msgid "The registration wizard guides you through a step-by-step process to ensure complete and accurate candidate data."
msgstr "登録ウィザードが手順を順に案内し、候補者データの完全性と正確性を確保します。"

msgid "Step 1: Identity Number Existence Check"
msgstr "ステップ1：身分証番号の重複確認"

msgid "<strong>Duplicate Prevention</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>重複の防止</strong>"

msgid "This step prevents duplicate registrations by checking if the candidate's identity number (KTP/NIK) already exists in the system."
msgstr "この手順では、候補者の身分証番号（KTP/NIK）がすでにシステムに存在するかを確認し、二重登録を防ぎます。"

msgid "Click <strong>LPK Menu → Candidate Registration (Wizard)</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>LPKメニュー → 候補者登録（ウィザード）</strong> をクリックします"

msgid "Enter the candidate's <strong>Identity Number (NIK/KTP)</strong>"
msgstr "候補者の <strong>身分証番号（NIK/KTP）</strong> を入力します"

msgid "Click <span class=\"badge badge-primary\">Check Availability</span>"
msgstr "<span class=\"badge badge-primary\">利用可否を確認</span> をクリックします"

msgid "System will verify:"
msgstr "システムが次を確認します："

msgid "If number exists → Show error and existing candidate details"
msgstr "番号が存在する場合 → エラーと既存の候補者情報を表示します"

msgid "If number is new → Proceed to next step"
msgstr "番号が新規の場合 → 次の手順に進みます"

msgid "Step 2: Basic Data Entry"
msgstr "ステップ2：基本データの入力"

msgid "Enter the candidate's personal and contact information:"
msgstr "候補者の個人情報と連絡先を入力します："

msgid "Personal Information:"
msgstr "個人情報："

msgid "Full Name (as per ID card)"
msgstr "氏名（身分証明書のとおり）"

msgid "Place of Birth"
msgstr "出生地"

msgid "Marital Status"
msgstr "婚姻状況"

msgid "Contact Information:"
msgstr "連絡先："

msgid "Phone Number"
msgstr "電話番号"

msgid "Address Information:"
msgstr "住所情報："

msgid "Complete Address"
msgstr "住所（全体）"

msgid "Province (Propinsi)"
msgstr "州（Propinsi）"

msgid "Regency (Kabupaten)"
msgstr "県（Kabupaten）"

msgid "District (Kecamatan)"
msgstr "郡（Kecamatan）"

msgid "Village (Kelurahan)"
msgstr "村・町（Kelurahan）"

msgid "Step 3: Association Data"
msgstr "ステップ3：関連データ"

msgid "Link the candidate to relevant entities:"
msgstr "候補者を関連する項目に紐付けます："

msgid "Education Background:"
msgstr "学歴："

msgid "Highest Education Level (Strata)"
msgstr "最終学歴（Strata）"

msgid "School/University Name"
msgstr "学校・大学名"

msgid "Graduation Year"
msgstr "卒業年"

msgid "Field of Study"
msgstr "専攻"

msgid "Work Experience:"
msgstr "職歴："

msgid "Previous Employment (if any)"
msgstr "以前の勤務先（ある場合）"

msgid "Job Position"
msgstr "職位"

msgid "Skills & Certifications:"
msgstr "技能・資格："

msgid "Relevant Skills"
msgstr "関連する技能"

msgid "Certificates/Training"
msgstr "資格・研修"

msgid "Language Proficiency"
msgstr "語学力"

msgid "Family Information:"
msgstr "家族情報："

msgid "Father's Name & Occupation"
msgstr "父の氏名・職業"

msgid "Mother's Name & Occupation"
msgstr "母の氏名・職業"

msgid "Emergency Contact Person"
msgstr "緊急連絡先の氏名"

msgid "Step 4: Review & Submit"
msgstr "ステップ4：確認して送信"

msgid "Review all entered information for accuracy"
msgstr "入力したすべての情報が正確か確認します"

msgid "Make corrections if needed by going back to previous steps"
msgstr "必要に応じて前の手順に戻って修正します"

msgid "Click <span class=\"badge badge-success\">Submit Registration</span>"
msgstr "<span class=\"badge badge-success\">登録を送信</span> をクリックします"

msgid "System automatically links candidate to YOUR institution"
msgstr "システムが候補者を自機関に自動で紐付けます"

msgid "Candidate is now visible in <strong>My Candidates</strong> list"
msgstr "候補者が <strong>自分の候補者</strong> 一覧に表示されます"

msgid "Managing Your Candidates"
msgstr "候補者の管理"

msgid "Viewing Your Candidates"
msgstr "候補者の閲覧"

msgid "Go to <strong>LPK Menu → My Candidates</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>LPKメニュー → 自分の候補者</strong> を開きます"

msgid "You will see ONLY candidates registered by your institution"
msgstr "表示されるのは自機関が登録した候補者のみです"

msgid "Use filters to search by:"
msgstr "次の条件で絞り込めます："

msgid "Registration Date"
msgstr "登録日"

msgid "<strong>Data Privacy</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>データのプライバシー</strong>"

msgid "For security and privacy, you cannot see candidates registered by other LPK institutions. This ensures each institution manages only their own data."
msgstr "セキュリティとプライバシーのため、他のLPK機関が登録した候補者は閲覧できません。これにより各機関は自らのデータのみを管理します。"

msgid "Editing Candidate Information"
msgstr "候補者情報の編集"

msgid "Find the candidate in <strong>My Candidates</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>自分の候補者</strong> で該当する候補者を探します"

msgid "Click <span class=\"badge badge-warning\">Edit</span>"
msgstr "<span class=\"badge badge-warning\">編集</span> をクリックします"

msgid "Update the necessary information"
msgstr "必要な情報を更新します"

msgid "Click <span class=\"badge badge-primary\">Save Changes</span>"
msgstr "<span class=\"badge badge-primary\">変更を保存</span> をクリックします"

msgid "Viewing Candidate Details"
msgstr "候補者の詳細表示"

msgid "Click <span class=\"badge badge-info\">View</span> on any candidate"
msgstr "任意の候補者の <span class=\"badge badge-info\">表示</span> をクリックします"

msgid "See complete profile including:"
msgstr "次を含む完全なプロフィールを確認できます："

msgid "Personal data"
msgstr "個人データ"

msgid "Education history"
msgstr "学歴"

msgid "Family information"
msgstr "家族情報"

msgid "Document submission status"
msgstr "書類の提出状況"

msgid "After registering a candidate, you must submit required documents stored in <strong>cms_lpk_candidate_documents</strong> database."
msgstr "候補者を登録したら、<strong>cms_lpk_candidate_documents</strong> データベースに保存される必要書類を提出する必要があります。"

msgid "Required Documents"
msgstr "必要書類"

msgid "Identity Card (KTP) - Scan/Photo"
msgstr "身分証明書（KTP）- スキャンまたは写真"

msgid "Family Card (KK)"
msgstr "家族台帳（KK）"

msgid "Birth Certificate"
msgstr "出生証明書"

msgid "Education Certificate (Ijazah)"
msgstr "卒業証明書（Ijazah）"

msgid "Academic Transcript"
msgstr "成績証明書"

msgid "Passport-size Photo (3x4 cm)"
msgstr "証明写真（3x4cm）"

msgid "Health Certificate"
msgstr "健康診断書"

msgid "Police Clearance (SKCK)"
msgstr "無犯罪証明書（SKCK）"

msgid "How to Submit Documents"
msgstr "書類を提出する方法"

msgid "Select the candidate from your list"
msgstr "一覧から候補者を選択します"

msgid "For each required document:"
msgstr "必要書類ごとに："

msgid "Click <span class=\"badge badge-primary\">Upload</span>"
msgstr "<span class=\"badge badge-primary\">アップロード</span> をクリックします"

msgid "Select file (PDF, JPG, PNG accepted)"
msgstr "ファイルを選択します（PDF、JPG、PNGに対応）"

msgid "Add notes if needed"
msgstr "必要に応じてメモを追加します"

msgid "Click <span class=\"badge badge-success\">Submit</span>"
msgstr "<span class=\"badge badge-success\">送信</span> をクリックします"

msgid "Track submission status in real-time"
msgstr "提出状況をリアルタイムで確認できます"

msgid "Document Dashboard"
msgstr "書類ダッシュボード"

msgid "Access <strong>LPK Menu → Document Dashboard</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>LPKメニュー → 書類ダッシュボード</strong> を開きます"

msgid "View statistics:"
msgstr "統計を確認します："

msgid "Total candidates"
msgstr "候補者の総数"

msgid "Documents submitted"
msgstr "提出済みの書類"

msgid "Documents pending"
msgstr "保留中の書類"

msgid "Documents approved/rejected"
msgstr "承認・却下された書類"

msgid "Monitor completion percentage per candidate"
msgstr "候補者ごとの完了率を確認します"

msgid "Database Structure"
msgstr "データベース構成"

msgid "Your LPK data is organized across two databases:"
msgstr "LPKのデータは2つのデータベースに分かれています："

msgid "<code>candidates</code> - Main candidate records"
msgstr "<code>candidates</code> - 候補者の主レコード"

msgid "<code>candidate_educations</code> - Education history"
msgstr "<code>candidate_educations</code> - 学歴"

msgid "<code>candidate_experiences</code> - Work experience"
msgstr "<code>candidate_experiences</code> - 職歴"

msgid "<code>candidate_families</code> - Family information"
msgstr "<code>candidate_families</code> - 家族情報"

msgid "<code>candidate_certifications</code> - Skills & certificates"
msgstr "<code>candidate_certifications</code> - 技能・資格"

msgid "<code>candidate_documents</code> - Uploaded files"
msgstr "<code>candidate_documents</code> - アップロードされたファイル"

msgid "<code>candidate_submission_documents</code> - Submission tracking"
msgstr "<code>candidate_submission_documents</code> - 提出の追跡"

msgid "<code>document_categories</code> - Document types"
msgstr "<code>document_categories</code> - 書類の種類"

msgid "<strong>Verify Identity:</strong> Always verify candidate's identity documents before registration"
msgstr "<strong>本人確認：</strong>登録前に必ず候補者の身分証明書を確認してください"

msgid "<strong>Complete Data:</strong> Fill all required fields to avoid processing delays"
msgstr "<strong>データの完全性：</strong>処理の遅れを防ぐため、必須フィールドはすべて入力してください"

msgid "<strong>Document Quality:</strong> Ensure uploaded documents are clear and legible"
msgstr "<strong>書類の品質：</strong>アップロードする書類が鮮明で読み取れることを確認してください"

msgid "<strong>Regular Updates:</strong> Keep candidate information current"
msgstr "<strong>定期的な更新：</strong>候補者の情報を最新に保ってください"

msgid "<strong>Timely Submission:</strong> Submit all required documents promptly"
msgstr "<strong>期限内の提出：</strong>必要書類は速やかに提出してください"

msgid "<strong>Follow-up:</strong> Monitor document approval status regularly"
msgstr "<strong>フォローアップ：</strong>書類の承認状況を定期的に確認してください"

msgid "Stakeholder Management - User Guide"
msgstr "ステークホルダー管理 - 利用ガイド"

msgid "Welcome to Stakeholder Management"
msgstr "ステークホルダー管理へようこそ"

msgid "This guide will help you understand how to manage stakeholders in the TMM Apprentice Management System. Stakeholders include organizations, institutions, and key partners involved in the apprenticeship program."
msgstr "このガイドでは、TMM実習生管理システムでステークホルダーを管理する方法を説明します。ステークホルダーには、実習プログラムに関わる団体、機関、主要な提携先が含まれます。"

msgid "What are Stakeholders?"
msgstr "ステークホルダーとは"

msgid "Stakeholders are organizations and institutions that play a role in the apprenticeship ecosystem:"
msgstr "ステークホルダーとは、実習制度において役割を担う団体や機関です："

msgid "<strong>Vocational Training Institutions (LPK):</strong> Organizations that train candidates"
msgstr "<strong>職業訓練機関（LPK）：</strong>候補者を育成する団体"

msgid "<strong>Acceptance Organizations:</strong> Japanese companies/organizations that accept apprentices"
msgstr "<strong>受入団体：</strong>技能実習生を受け入れる日本の企業・団体"

msgid "<strong>Cooperative Associations:</strong> Cooperative organizations that facilitate placements"
msgstr "<strong>協同組合：</strong>配属を仲介する協同組合"

msgid "<strong>Special Skill Support Institutions:</strong> Organizations providing additional training support"
msgstr "<strong>特定技能支援機関：</strong>追加の研修支援を提供する団体"

msgid "Managing Stakeholder Records"
msgstr "ステークホルダー情報の管理"

msgid "How to View Stakeholder Information"
msgstr "ステークホルダー情報を表示する方法"

msgid "Navigate to <strong>Stakeholder Management</strong> from the main menu"
msgstr "メインメニューから <strong>ステークホルダー管理</strong> を開きます"

msgid "Select the specific stakeholder type:"
msgstr "対象のステークホルダー種別を選択します："

msgid "Browse the list or use the search/filter features"
msgstr "一覧を閲覧するか、検索・絞り込み機能を使用します"

msgid "Click on any record to view detailed information"
msgstr "任意のレコードをクリックすると詳細が表示されます"

msgid "How to Add a New Stakeholder"
msgstr "新しいステークホルダーを追加する方法"

msgid "Navigate to the specific stakeholder type page"
msgstr "対象のステークホルダー種別のページを開きます"

msgid "Click the <span class=\"badge badge-primary\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i> New</span> button"
msgstr "<span class=\"badge badge-primary\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i> 新規</span> ボタンをクリックします"

msgid "Fill in the required information:"
msgstr "必要な情報を入力します："

msgid "<strong>Name/Title:</strong> Official organization name"
msgstr "<strong>名称：</strong>団体の正式名称"

msgid "<strong>Address:</strong> Complete physical address"
msgstr "<strong>住所：</strong>所在地の住所（全体）"

msgid "<strong>Contact Information:</strong> Phone, email, website"
msgstr "<strong>連絡先：</strong>電話、メール、ウェブサイト"

msgid "<strong>Is Active:</strong> Set organization status"
msgstr "<strong>有効：</strong>団体のステータスを設定します"

msgid "Add any additional details specific to the stakeholder type"
msgstr "そのステークホルダー種別に固有の情報を追加します"

msgid "Click <span class=\"badge badge-success\"><i class=\"fas fa-save\"></i> Submit</span> to save"
msgstr "保存するには <span class=\"badge badge-success\"><i class=\"fas fa-save\"></i> 送信</span> をクリックします"

msgid "How to Edit Stakeholder Information"
msgstr "ステークホルダー情報を編集する方法"

msgid "Find the stakeholder record in the list"
msgstr "一覧で該当するステークホルダーを探します"

msgid "Click the <span class=\"badge badge-warning\"><i class=\"fas fa-edit\"></i> Edit</span> button"
msgstr "<span class=\"badge badge-warning\"><i class=\"fas fa-edit\"></i> 編集</span> ボタンをクリックします"

msgid "Click <span class=\"badge badge-success\"><i class=\"fas fa-save\"></i> Save</span> to update"
msgstr "更新するには <span class=\"badge badge-success\"><i class=\"fas fa-save\"></i> 保存</span> をクリックします"

msgid "<strong>Purpose:</strong> LPK organizations train candidates before they go to Japan."
msgstr "<strong>目的：</strong>LPKは候補者が日本へ渡る前に育成を行います。"

msgid "Key Information to Manage:"
msgstr "管理すべき主な情報："

msgid "<strong>Institution Name:</strong> Official LPK name"
msgstr "<strong>機関名：</strong>LPKの正式名称"

msgid "<strong>License Number:</strong> Government registration number"
msgstr "<strong>許可番号：</strong>政府の登録番号"

msgid "<strong>Location:</strong> Province, city, complete address"
msgstr "<strong>所在地：</strong>州、市、住所（全体）"

msgid "<strong>Capacity:</strong> Maximum number of trainees"
msgstr "<strong>受入可能数：</strong>研修生の最大人数"

msgid "<strong>Specializations:</strong> Job categories/skills offered"
msgstr "<strong>専門分野：</strong>提供する職種・技能"

msgid "<strong>Contact Person:</strong> Director and staff contact information"
msgstr "<strong>担当者：</strong>代表者および職員の連絡先"

msgid "<strong>Important:</strong> LPK users with role \"lpk-penyangga\" can only view and manage candidates from their own institution."
msgstr "<strong>重要：</strong>「lpk-penyangga」の役割を持つLPKユーザーは、自機関の候補者のみ閲覧・管理できます。"

msgid "<strong>Purpose:</strong> Japanese companies/organizations that accept apprentices for training."
msgstr "<strong>目的：</strong>技能実習生を研修のために受け入れる日本の企業・団体です。"

msgid "<strong>Organization Name:</strong> Official company name (Japanese and English)"
msgstr "<strong>団体名：</strong>企業の正式名称（日本語および英語）"

msgid "<strong>Industry Type:</strong> Manufacturing, construction, hospitality, etc."
msgstr "<strong>業種：</strong>製造、建設、宿泊など"

msgid "<strong>Location:</strong> Prefecture and city in Japan"
msgstr "<strong>所在地：</strong>日本の都道府県および市"

msgid "<strong>Job Categories:</strong> Types of work offered"
msgstr "<strong>職種：</strong>提供される作業の種類"

msgid "<strong>Capacity:</strong> Number of apprentices they can accept"
msgstr "<strong>受入可能数：</strong>受け入れられる技能実習生の人数"

msgid "<strong>Contact Information:</strong> Representative and contact details"
msgstr "<strong>連絡先：</strong>担当者および連絡先の詳細"

msgid "<strong>Purpose:</strong> Organizations that facilitate placement and support for apprentices in Japan."
msgstr "<strong>目的：</strong>日本での技能実習生の配属と支援を仲介する団体です。"

msgid "<strong>Association Name:</strong> Official cooperative name"
msgstr "<strong>組合名：</strong>協同組合の正式名称"

msgid "<strong>License/Registration:</strong> OTIT registration number"
msgstr "<strong>許可・登録：</strong>OTITの登録番号"

msgid "<strong>Service Area:</strong> Regions/prefectures they serve"
msgstr "<strong>対応地域：</strong>担当する地域・都道府県"

msgid "<strong>Member Organizations:</strong> Associated acceptance organizations"
msgstr "<strong>加盟団体：</strong>関連する受入団体"

msgid "<strong>Support Services:</strong> Types of support provided to apprentices"
msgstr "<strong>支援内容：</strong>技能実習生に提供する支援の種類"

msgid "User Roles & Permissions"
msgstr "ユーザーの役割と権限"

msgid "Access Level"
msgstr "アクセス権限"

msgid "Stakeholder Management"
msgstr "ステークホルダー管理"

msgid "<span class=\"badge badge-danger\">Administrator</span>"
msgstr "<span class=\"badge badge-danger\">管理者</span>"

msgid "Full Access"
msgstr "フルアクセス"

msgid "Create, Read, Update, Delete all stakeholders"
msgstr "すべてのステークホルダーの作成、閲覧、更新、削除"

msgid "<span class=\"badge badge-info\">Management</span>"
msgstr "<span class=\"badge badge-info\">経営層</span>"

msgid "Read-Only"
msgstr "閲覧のみ"

msgid "View all stakeholder information, export reports"
msgstr "すべてのステークホルダー情報の閲覧とレポート出力"

msgid "<span class=\"badge badge-success\">TMM Recruitment</span>"
msgstr "<span class=\"badge badge-success\">TMM採用</span>"

msgid "Manage stakeholders related to recruitment"
msgstr "採用に関わるステークホルダーの管理"

msgid "<span class=\"badge badge-warning\">LPK User</span>"
msgstr "<span class=\"badge badge-warning\">LPKユーザー</span>"

msgid "Institution-Scoped"
msgstr "自機関に限定"

msgid "View only their own institution information"
msgstr "自機関の情報のみ閲覧"

msgid "Do's"
msgstr "推奨されること"

msgid "Keep stakeholder information up-to-date"
msgstr "ステークホルダー情報を最新に保つ"

msgid "Verify contact information regularly"
msgstr "連絡先を定期的に確認する"

msgid "Document all important communications"
msgstr "重要なやり取りを記録する"

msgid "Maintain accurate capacity numbers"
msgstr "受入可能数を正確に保つ"

msgid "Update status when organizations become inactive"
msgstr "団体が活動を停止したらステータスを更新する"

msgid "Use clear, consistent naming conventions"
msgstr "分かりやすく一貫した命名規則を使う"

msgid "Don'ts"
msgstr "避けるべきこと"

msgid "Don't delete stakeholders with active apprentices"
msgstr "実習中の技能実習生がいるステークホルダーを削除しないでください"

msgid "Don't share sensitive organization information"
msgstr "団体の機密情報を共有しないでください"

msgid "Don't modify records without proper authorization"
msgstr "正当な権限なくレコードを変更しないでください"

msgid "Don't forget to mark inactive organizations"
msgstr "活動していない団体への印を忘れないでください"

msgid "Don't duplicate stakeholder records"
msgstr "ステークホルダーのレコードを重複して作らないでください"

msgid "Don't skip required fields"
msgstr "必須フィールドを飛ばさないでください"

msgid "Common Tasks"
msgstr "よく行う操作"

msgid "How to search for a specific stakeholder?"
msgstr "特定のステークホルダーを検索する方法"

msgid "Go to the stakeholder list page"
msgstr "ステークホルダー一覧のページを開きます"

msgid "Use the search box at the top of the table"
msgstr "表の上にある検索ボックスを使用します"

msgid "Enter the organization name or other identifier"
msgstr "団体名またはその他の識別情報を入力します"

